pyra-settings (0.3) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Idle sleep suspends: picking an idle time also sets MATE's idle sleep
    type to suspend where it was hibernate (NEXT 1.6, 2.7).
  * Wake settings that can't be read grey out their rows, and the reason
    stays in the status line (NEXT 1.6).
  * "Saved" stays in the status line for 3 s.

